// AccountTotal What the account has made, all in: the sum of every position's total (realized, income, unrealized) plus the account's own charges — interest on the cash, and commissions and tax booked on their own and charged to no paper — and, in the base currency only, the currency result on its money in other currencies (cash_fx_in_base). Deposits and withdrawals are not in it. Published per currency and in the base currency.
